{"format":"edusim-world","version":1,"exportedAt":"2026-08-18T13:23:35.456Z","records":[{"id":"d0ad0858-84b5-4bb2-a11e-e30552a972d1","kind":"world-theme","theme":"robots","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[0,0,0],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]}},{"id":"0f7cf572-4610-4afa-85de-e6808cba5605","kind":"world-spawn","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[0,0,66],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]}},{"id":"daaa9a64-59e6-4789-a16a-785f6325fc2a","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[-26,0,14],"rotation":[0,0.4636476090008061,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"robot-pad","options":{"seed":300,"size":17,"accent":"#22b3cc","mark":"line","number":1,"name":"Blip","start":[0,-4.5]}},{"id":"9012ab2c-b6d4-483d-893a-3ff0ab3ee9d4","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[-28.01246117974981,0.19,9.975077640500379],"rotation":[0,0.4636476090008061,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"robot","options":{"seed":400,"skin":"cyan","height":6.4}},{"id":"f34de3a2-c284-4605-b0f8-1f925ed42c26","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[-13,0,22],"rotation":[0,0.625485040239229,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":1,"title":"Send Blip down the lane and back","target":"the blue robot on pad 1","steps":[{"cat":"motion","text":"move forward 9 feet","depth":0},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 1 seconds","depth":0},{"cat":"motion","text":"go back to start","depth":0}],"tip":"No loop at all — these three run once, top to bottom, and then stop. `go back to start` always means the exact spot the robot was standing in when you pressed play, however far it has wandered since.","accent":"#22b3cc"}},{"id":"a23564a1-c1a8-4da5-9d48-3f0c4fc0640a","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[27,0,-6],"rotation":[0,-0.3587706702705722,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"robot-pad","options":{"seed":301,"size":17,"accent":"#e0453c","mark":"spin","number":2,"name":"Spark","start":[0,0]}},{"id":"0afa4b03-9d36-4734-aab1-6cb7c34ba199","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[27,0.19,-6],"rotation":[0,-0.3587706702705722,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"robot","options":{"seed":401,"skin":"coral","height":6.4}},{"id":"02e0b522-4ae5-4f2a-ba9b-71a16ef49412","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[14,0,2],"rotation":[0,-0.6610431688506868,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":2,"title":"Spin Spark on the spot","target":"the red robot on pad 2","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"forever","depth":0},{"cat":"motion","text":"rotate 4 degrees","depth":1}],"tip":"The number is degrees per turn of the loop, not per second. Try 1, then try 20, then try -4 — and count the four painted ticks to see how far a quarter turn really is.","accent":"#e0453c"}},{"id":"f3f2aa47-1a21-4c9d-9ed9-fa61a2159960","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[-28,0,-27],"rotation":[0,0.2924429874520365,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"robot-pad","options":{"seed":302,"size":17,"accent":"#74c043","mark":"square","number":3,"name":"Turbo","start":[-4,-4]}},{"id":"8cb1e169-20a3-49a4-af86-e0719c36fe4d","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[-32.983339145015265,0.19,-29.67700036715696],"rotation":[0,0.2924429874520365,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"robot","options":{"seed":402,"skin":"lime","height":6.4}},{"id":"6376611b-2a04-48e6-b0b3-99d3a8499ae8","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[-14,0,-19],"rotation":[0,0.6610431688506868,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":3,"title":"Drive Turbo round the painted square","target":"the green robot on pad 3","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"forever","depth":0},{"cat":"control","text":"repeat 4 times","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"move forward 8 feet","depth":2},{"cat":"motion","text":"rotate 90 degrees","depth":2}],"tip":"360 divided by 4 is 90, which is the whole reason Turbo lands back on the corner it started from. Try repeat 3 with rotate 120, or repeat 6 with rotate 60 — the paint on the pad is there to check yourself against.","accent":"#74c043"}},{"id":"26fecab0-a8c7-4a4c-a612-786067d5417d","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[28,0,-47],"rotation":[0,-0.24289533280760475,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"robot-pad","options":{"seed":303,"size":17,"accent":"#f2971f","mark":"course","number":4,"name":"Hopper","start":[-4.4,-4.4]}},{"id":"009e8064-fcef-4cb5-8385-6379b5a354e4","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[24.787420505109036,0.19,-52.32910245623089],"rotation":[0,-0.24289533280760475,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"robot","options":{"seed":403,"skin":"amber","height":6.4}},{"id":"7b2d4557-700e-486b-ae31-ab73b47cc760","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[15,0,-39],"rotation":[0,-0.6947382761967033,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":4,"title":"Patrol the course, and hop at every corner","target":"the orange robot on pad 4","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"forever","depth":0},{"cat":"motion","text":"move forward 8.8 feet","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"move up by 3 feet","depth":1},{"cat":"control","text":"wait 0.4 seconds","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"move up by -3 feet","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"rotate 90 degrees","depth":1}],"tip":"`move up by` is the ONE movement block that ignores which way a robot is facing — up is up whichever way it is pointing. Make the two numbers different and Hopper climbs away into the sky, which is worth doing once.","accent":"#f2971f"}},{"id":"193adcf8-e5f6-4a96-99df-06c748c51b7b","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[0,0,-68],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"robot-pad","options":{"seed":304,"size":17,"accent":"#8352d9","mark":"signal","number":5,"name":"Echo","start":[0,0]}},{"id":"02feb79a-2c9e-463e-8b44-f7957b83d932","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[0,0.19,-68],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"robot","options":{"seed":404,"skin":"violet","height":6.4}},{"id":"d403ffaf-cd15-4489-9103-75384280af63","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[-14,0,-60],"rotation":[0,0.6610431688506868,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"activity-board","options":{"number":5,"title":"Make Echo wait for a signal from Hopper","target":"the purple robot at the end of the avenue","steps":[{"cat":"control","text":"on Echo:  when an object says  go","depth":0},{"cat":"control","text":"repeat 4 times","depth":1},{"cat":"motion","text":"move forward 7 feet","depth":2},{"cat":"motion","text":"rotate 90 degrees","depth":2},{"cat":"look","text":"on Hopper:  say  go","depth":0}],"tip":"The hardest one, and the only one that needs TWO robots. `when an object says` is a hat — it does NOT run when you press play, it runs when any object anywhere in the world says that exact word. Build Echo first, then give Hopper a `say go` block and press play on Hopper.","accent":"#8352d9"}},{"id":"172fe736-82de-41a6-9db9-70d19a9880cc","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[0,0,42],"rotation":[0,0,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"signal-arch","options":{"seed":81,"span":20,"height":13,"bands":6}},{"id":"bb03ff9e-6193-4812-8eed-3e203afd3ff3","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"position":[25,0,33],"rotation":[0,-0.6483319890872606,0],"scale":[1,1,1]},"kind":"preset-prop","prop":"welcome-board","options":{"eyebrow":"🤖  ROBOT CHALLENGE FIELD","lead":"Five robots. Five programs. Each one harder than the last.","lines":["Walk down the avenue — bay 1 is nearest.","Click a robot, choose Program, build the blocks."],"footnote":"The paint on each pad shows the path its program should trace"}},{"id":"085dc959-8fc9-49f1-a3ff-2fe4ebbf6a22","createdAt":1787059415455,"transform":{"po